        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    original_shares = 2000\n    original_cost_per_share = 10.50\n    stock_dividend_rate = 0.05\n    stock_split_ratio = 2\n    shares_sold = 800\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_cost_basis = original_shares * original_cost_per_share\n    shares_after_dividend = original_shares * (1 + stock_dividend_rate)\n    shares_after_split = shares_after_dividend * stock_split_ratio\n    adjusted_basis_per_share = total_cost_basis / shares_after_split\n    answer = round(shares_sold * adjusted_basis_per_share)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
